# dist/ is NOT ignored, unusually: it is build output and it is committed.
# fold vendors it from this repo at a pinned commit and builds from the Go
# module proxy alone, which runs no generators — so the built assets have to
# be in git or they never reach an operator. CI rebuilds and fails on a diff.

